  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BOOST-Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The HRDD Boost builds on the knowledge and network that come from CNV Internationaal, Fair Wear Foundation and  Mondiaal FNV collective work in the garment industry and with workers and their representatives in Asia. This program is complementary to STITCH, with the focus on the opportunities of CSDDD for the local stakeholders and governments, how to standardize local stakeholder information, bring it to scale and create the feedback loop. Also, how we can use the evidence and good practices to lobby flanking policy.</narrative>
  </description>
